 local rates vary by location, which is why you might pay a different total rate in different cities within Tennessee.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-card/80 p-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What items are exempt from sales tax in Tennessee?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"In Tennessee, groceries, prescription drugs are exempt from state sales tax. However, clothing are still subject to sales tax. Exemptions may vary at the local level.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"3\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-card/80 p-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How do I calculate sales tax in Tennessee?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Multiply the purchase price by the combined tax rate. For example, on a $100 purchase at the 9.56% combined rate in Tennessee: $100 × 0.956 = $9.56 in tax. Total price: $109.56.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-card/80 p-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h3\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Does Tennessee charge sales tax on online purchases?\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Yes. Following the 2018 South Dakota v. Wayfair Supreme Court ruling, online retailers must collect Tennessee sales tax on purchases shipped to Tennessee residents. The rate is based on the buyer's location within Tennessee.\\\"}]]}]]}]]}]\