late sales tax in Tennessee?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Multiply the purchase price by the combined tax rate. For example, on a $100 purchase at the 9.56% combined rate in Tennessee: $100 × 0.956 = $9.56 in tax. Total price: $109.56.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-card/80 p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Does Tennessee charge sales tax on online purchases?\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes. Following the 2018 South Dakota v. Wayfair Supreme Court ruling, online retailers must collect Tennessee sales tax on purchases shipped to Tennessee residents. The rate is based on the buyer's location within Tennessee.\"}]]}]]}]]}]\na:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-foreground mb-4\",\"children\":\"Nearby State Sales Tax Calculators\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L6\",null,{\"href\":\"/sales-tax-calculator\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/30 bg-emerald-500/10 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-emerald-400 hover:bg-emerald-500/20 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"All 50 States\"}],[[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"kentucky\",{\"href\":\"/sales-tax-calculator/kentucky\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-card/80 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors\",\"children\":\"Kentucky (6.00%)\"}],[\"$\",\"$L6\",\"virginia\",{\"href\":\"/sales-tax-calculator/virginia\",\"className\":\"inline-flex items-center rounded-lg border border-border/50 bg-card/80 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors\",\"childr